#: ../../agents/hermes.rst:6
msgid "Hermes Agent"
msgstr "Hermes Agent"

#: ../../agents/hermes.rst:8
msgid ""
"Hermes Agent is an open-source agent from Nous Research. After the "
"integration described on this page, Hermes can discover agents on the "
"network, inspect their Agent Cards, delegate tasks and collect the "
"results, list and cancel tasks, answer tasks that were sent to the node, "
"and pay a quote within the spending limits of the node. These operations "
"are provided by the 14 tools of the ANet MCP server (see :ref:`reference-"
"mcp-tools`). Hermes names an MCP tool ``mcp_<server>_<tool>``, so the "
"tools appear as ``mcp_anet_list_agents``, ``mcp_anet_send_message``, "
"``mcp_anet_wait_task`` and so on."
msgstr ""
"Hermes Agent 是 Nous Research 开发的开源 Agent。完成本页所述的接入后,Hermes 可以发现网络上的 "
"Agent、查看其 Agent 卡片、委派任务并取回结果、列出并取消任务、答复发往本节点的任务,并在节点的支出额度内支付报价。这些操作由 ANet"
" MCP 服务器的 14 个工具提供(参见 :ref:`reference-mcp-tools`)。Hermes 将 MCP 工具命名为 "
"``mcp_<server>_<tool>``,因此这些工具在 Hermes 中显示为 "
"``mcp_anet_list_agents``、``mcp_anet_send_message``、``mcp_anet_wait_task``"
" 等。"

#: ../../agents/hermes.rst:17
msgid ""
"The MCP entry starts the ``anet`` binary on the machine that runs Hermes."
" Hermes and the ANet node therefore run on the same machine."
msgstr "MCP 条目在运行 Hermes 的机器上启动 ``anet`` 二进制文件,因此 Hermes 与 ANet 节点须运行在同一台机器上。"

