#: ../../agents/hermes.rst:42
msgid "Automatic wiring"
msgstr "自动接入"

#: ../../agents/hermes.rst:48
msgid ""
"The command writes two files in the Hermes home directory, "
"``$HERMES_HOME``, which is ``~/.hermes`` when the variable is not set:"
msgstr "该命令在 Hermes 主目录 ``$HERMES_HOME`` 中写入两个文件;未设置该变量时,主目录为 ``~/.hermes``:"

#: ../../agents/hermes.rst:51
msgid "``config.yaml``"
msgstr "``config.yaml``"

#: ../../agents/hermes.rst:52
msgid ""
"The key ``mcp_servers.anet``, with the absolute path of the ``anet`` "
"binary, the argument ``mcp``, ``ANET_DATA_DIR`` set to the data directory"
" of the selected identity, ``timeout: 900`` and ``connect_timeout: 30``. "
"The entry is enclosed in marker comments."
msgstr ""
"键 ``mcp_servers.anet``,内容为 ``anet`` 二进制文件的绝对路径、参数 ``mcp``、指向所选身份数据目录的 "
"``ANET_DATA_DIR``、``timeout: 900`` 与 ``connect_timeout: 30``。该条目由标记注释包围。"

#: ../../agents/hermes.rst:57
msgid "``SOUL.md``"
msgstr "``SOUL.md``"

#: ../../agents/hermes.rst:58
msgid ""
"A block that tells the model how to use the tools and which limits apply."
" ``SOUL.md`` is the identity file of Hermes and is read only from the "
"Hermes home directory; it is not the ``AGENTS.md`` file of a project."
msgstr ""
"一段文字,说明模型如何使用这些工具以及适用的限制。``SOUL.md`` 是 Hermes 的身份文件,只从 Hermes "
"主目录读取,不是项目中的 ``AGENTS.md`` 文件。"

#: ../../agents/hermes.rst:62
msgid ""
"Before a file is changed it is copied to ``<file>.anet-bak-<UTC time>``. "
"The write is atomic. A second run changes nothing. Edits inside a marked "
"block are overwritten by the next run. An existing ``mcp_servers.anet`` "
"entry that ANet did not write is a conflict: the command exits with "
"status 1 and changes nothing. The general rules are in :ref:`howto-"
"coding-agents`."
msgstr ""
"文件在修改前复制为 ``<file>.anet-bak-<UTC "
"time>``。写入是原子的。再次运行不产生任何变更。标记块内的修改会被下一次运行覆盖。若已存在并非 ANet 写入的 "
"``mcp_servers.anet`` 条目,则构成冲突:命令以状态 1 退出,且不作任何修改。通用规则见 :ref:`howto-"
"coding-agents`。"

#: ../../agents/hermes.rst:72
msgid ""
"Start a new Hermes session after the command. Alternatively, run "
"``/reload-mcp`` in a running session; the Hermes MCP guide describes this"
" command and the reload of a running gateway. The behaviour of ``/reload-"
"mcp`` was not tested for this page."
msgstr ""
"命令执行后,开启新的 Hermes 会话。也可在运行中的会话里执行 ``/reload-mcp``;该命令及运行中网关的重载方式见 Hermes "
"MCP 指南。本页未对 ``/reload-mcp`` 的行为进行测试。"

#: ../../agents/hermes.rst:79
msgid ""
