"environment variable ``HERMES_HOME`` to the directory that Hermes uses "
"before the command is run."
msgstr ""
"在原生 Windows 上,Hermes 的文件位于 ``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\hermes``,而 ``anet agents "
"wire`` 默认使用 ``$HOME/.hermes``。运行命令前,须将环境变量 ``HERMES_HOME`` 设为 Hermes "
"实际使用的目录。"

