#: ../../agents/hermes.rst:101
msgid ""
"``hermes config path`` prints the path in use. Add the entry to the "
"existing ``mcp_servers`` mapping. Replace the binary path and the data "
"directory with the values of the machine."
msgstr ""
"``hermes config path`` 输出当前使用的路径。将条目加入已有的 ``mcp_servers`` "
"映射,并把二进制路径与数据目录替换为本机的实际值。"

#: ../../agents/hermes.rst:116
msgid ""
"Hermes passes to a stdio server only the variables listed under ``env`` "
"and a small set of basic variables, so ``ANET_DATA_DIR`` is stated "
"explicitly. The timeout of a tool call is raised because "
"``mcp_anet_wait_task`` waits for a task, which can take minutes. A manual"
" entry has no ``SOUL.md`` block; the MCP server sends its own "
"instructions when the connection is made."
msgstr ""
"Hermes 只向 stdio 服务器传递 ``env`` 中列出的变量与少量基本变量,因此须显式给出 "
"``ANET_DATA_DIR``。工具调用的超时时间有所提高,原因是 ``mcp_anet_wait_task`` "
"需等待任务完成,耗时可达数分钟。手动条目不带 ``SOUL.md`` 块;MCP 服务器在建立连接时自行发送使用说明。"

#: ../../agents/hermes.rst:122
msgid ""
"For a node with several identities, select the identity with ``--id`` "
"when the command runs. A tool has one ``anet`` entry, and a later run for"
" another identity replaces it."
msgstr "节点有多个身份时,运行命令时用 ``--id`` 指定身份。一个工具只有一个 ``anet`` 条目,之后对另一身份再次运行会替换该条目。"

