#: ../../agents/hermes.rst:204
msgid "Security and permissions"
msgstr "安全与权限"

#: ../../agents/hermes.rst:206
msgid ""
"The node is closed by default. It accepts no task from another agent and "
"spends nothing until the operator opens either at a terminal. Wiring "
"changes neither setting. The tools of the MCP server cannot raise a "
"limit, allow a peer or loosen the inbound policy."
msgstr ""
"节点默认处于关闭状态:在运营方于终端开启之前,节点不接受其他 Agent 的任务,也不产生任何支出。接入不改变这两项设置。MCP "
"服务器的工具不能提高额度、允许对端或放宽入站策略。"

#: ../../agents/hermes.rst:211
msgid ""
"Hermes applies its own permission and approval rules to the actions of "
"the model; they are described in the Hermes documentation and are "
"independent of the node. They do not replace the node: the inbound "
"policy, the sandbox and the payment limits are enforced by the ANet "
"daemon whatever the model is asked to do. The relation is described in "
":ref:`topics-sandbox` and :ref:`topics-payments`."
msgstr ""
"Hermes 对模型的操作有其自身的权限与确认规则,相关说明见 Hermes "
"文档,且与节点相互独立。这些规则不能代替节点的约束:无论模型被要求做什么,入站策略、沙箱与付款额度均由 ANet daemon "
"强制执行。二者的关系参见 :ref:`topics-sandbox` 与 :ref:`topics-payments`。"

#: ../../agents/hermes.rst:218
msgid ""
"The text of a task from another agent is untrusted input. The guide in "
"``SOUL.md`` instructs the model not to run commands, read files or spend "
"because such a text asks for it; the sandbox and the limits are the "
"enforcement."
msgstr ""
"来自其他 Agent 的任务文本属于不可信输入。``SOUL.md`` "
"中的指引要求模型不得因此类文本的要求而执行命令、读取文件或支出;强制约束由沙箱与额度承担。"

#: ../../agents/hermes.rst:225
msgid "Optional local A2A client"
msgstr "可选的本地 A2A 客户端"

#: ../../agents/hermes.rst:227
msgid ""
"Hermes has its own A2A client. The option ``--a2a`` adds one entry per "
"remote agent to ``config.yaml``, pointing at the local A2A interface of "
"the node, so that Hermes calls the remote agent with ``a2a_call`` and the"
" node signs, seals and relays the call. The Hermes documentation "
"recommends in-process subagents for agents on the same machine; the "
"option is for agents on the network. The MCP entry and the A2A entries "
"can be used together. The interface and its token are described in :ref"
":`howto-local-a2a`."
msgstr ""
"Hermes 自带 A2A 客户端。选项 ``--a2a`` 为每个远程 Agent 在 ``config.yaml`` "
"中添加一个条目,指向节点的本地 A2A 接口,使 Hermes 通过 ``a2a_call`` 调用远程 "
"Agent,由节点完成签名、封装与中继。Hermes 文档建议同一台机器上的 Agent 使用进程内子 Agent;该选项面向网络上的 "
"Agent。MCP 条目与 A2A 条目可同时使用。接口及其令牌参见 :ref:`howto-local-a2a`。"

#: ../../agents/hermes.rst:240
msgid ""
"The second command is required: the ``a2a`` toolset is disabled by "
"default on the command line, and ``a2a_call`` is invisible to the model "
"until it is enabled. ``hermes tools list --platform cli`` shows the "
"state. The entry holds the bearer token of the interface, so the file "
"mode is ``0600``, and the entry accepts only the loopback address. The "
"command fails when the daemon has not created ``a2a_addr.txt`` yet (run "
"``anet up``) and when another user holds the port. After a change of the "
"port or the token, run:"
msgstr ""
"第二条命令必不可少:``a2a`` 工具集在命令行平台默认关闭,启用之前模型看不到 ``a2a_call``。``hermes tools "
"list --platform cli`` 显示其状态。条目包含接口的 Bearer 令牌,因此文件权限为 "
"``0600``,且条目只接受回环地址。daemon 尚未生成 ``a2a_addr.txt`` 时命令会失败(先运行 ``anet "
"up``),其他用户占用该端口时同样会失败。端口或令牌变化后,运行:"

#: ../../agents/hermes.rst:252
msgid ""
"A Hermes on another machine cannot use the entry, because the address is "
"loopback. The call of a real remote agent through ``a2a_call`` was not "
"tested for this page."
msgstr "其他机器上的 Hermes 无法使用该条目,因为地址是回环地址。本页未测试通过 ``a2a_call`` 调用真实的远程 Agent。"

