"codes`。"

#: ../../agents/hermes.rst:304
msgid "Disconnecting"
msgstr "断开"

#: ../../agents/hermes.rst:310
msgid ""
"The command removes the ``mcp_servers.anet`` entry, the block in "
"``SOUL.md`` and every ``a2a_agents`` entry with its token, and keeps a "
"backup of each changed file. ``anet agents unwire hermes --a2a <aid>`` "
"removes only the entry of that agent. To disconnect by hand, delete the "
"marked blocks from ``config.yaml`` and ``SOUL.md``, then start a new "
"session. Backups made by ``wire`` can still contain a token and are "
"deleted by the operator."
msgstr ""
"该命令删除 ``mcp_servers.anet`` 条目、``SOUL.md`` 中的块以及全部 ``a2a_agents`` "
"条目(连同其令牌),并为每个被修改的文件保留备份。``anet agents unwire hermes --a2a <aid>`` 只删除该 "
"Agent 的条目。手动断开时,从 ``config.yaml`` 与 ``SOUL.md`` 中删除标记块,然后开启新会话。``wire`` "
"生成的备份仍可能含有令牌,须由运营方自行删除。"

